direction: right
registry: Registry count and permanent symbol/keyword identities
transaction: "global_gate: query -> native allocation -> checked copy"
shared: Shared checked identity-copy primitive
scheme: Scheme allocates/roots vector outside gate
native: Private native identity array
callback: "Unlock -> normal returning callback\nGC / interning / nested snapshot"
release: Free array exactly once
failure: "Unlock / free if acquired\nno callback"
tty: "Actual complete_word caller\nCANNOT_COMPLETE before edits"
registry -> transaction
transaction -> shared
scheme -> shared: locked copy
shared -> native: complete validated snapshot
native -> callback
callback -> release
transaction -> failure: allocation or validation refusal
failure -> tty
callback -> registry: new publications excluded from outer snapshot
